    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The final bell has already rung, but something won\u2019t let go...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/10f2c83e23a3eeab622a0b47005f2e55.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/8f6a8093068dc621f311e94e5aa25a67.poster.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/8f6a8093068dc621f311e94e5aa25a67.webm?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/8f6a8093068dc621f311e94e5aa25a67.mp4?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the school, piece together clues, and confront the entities that bind you to this endless day. Every loop reveals another piece of the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/9b9021ea47fa51c71d5870f4762444c0.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/ca481e2bfd385ceaab85f6c68188031f.poster.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/ca481e2bfd385ceaab85f6c68188031f.webm?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/ca481e2bfd385ceaab85f6c68188031f.mp4?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings closely, any subtle change will decide your next move. Some anomalies are minor, others far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/5f1bbef0d0d91a1686850661d1ec4dc3.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot any anomalies, take the stairs down. Otherwise, if everything feels normal, head up. This will determine whether you escape or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The final bell has already rung, but something won\u2019t let go...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/10f2c83e23a3eeab622a0b47005f2e55.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/8f6a8093068dc621f311e94e5aa25a67.poster.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/8f6a8093068dc621f311e94e5aa25a67.webm?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/8f6a8093068dc621f311e94e5aa25a67.mp4?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the school, piece together clues, and confront the entities that bind you to this endless day. Every loop reveals another piece of the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/9b9021ea47fa51c71d5870f4762444c0.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/ca481e2bfd385ceaab85f6c68188031f.poster.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/ca481e2bfd385ceaab85f6c68188031f.webm?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/ca481e2bfd385ceaab85f6c68188031f.mp4?t=1755299979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings closely, any subtle change will decide your next move. Some anomalies are minor, others far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/5f1bbef0d0d91a1686850661d1ec4dc3.avif?t=1755299979\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot any anomalies, take the stairs down. Otherwise, if everything feels normal, head up. This will determine whether you escape or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
